WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.350
I'm home.

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.940
Welcome home, Kana.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.670
Hey, Haruka! What is today's afternoon snack?

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:18.120
I have prepared it - your favorite cheese lemon custard chiffon pie.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.500
Great!

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.280
Welcome back.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.870
What, Touma? You've come.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:33.920
It looks delicious.

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:36.420
Let's see how it tastes...

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:39.730
Haruka prepared your share, didn't she?

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.440
Well... Don't be so formal.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:52.240
Give back my afternoon snack!

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:02.900
Touma is getting out of hand recently.

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.990
She gave me a head butt earlier just because I took a bite off her afternoon snack.

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:08.460
Isn't that your fault to begin with?

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:10.700
Well, taking Touma's snack is...

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:12.800
What's wrong with both of you?

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.280
It doesn't hurt to take a bit, right?

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:22.540
Fujioka has been training her recently, right?

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:26.350
I think her head butt is close to reaching the standard of a header.

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:29.390
Shall we make her stop acting like a guy?

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:33.760
Speaking of which, that Akira mentioned something about that...

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:41.270
Ever since Touma started visiting your house frequently, our family has been thinking...

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:46.900
Touma, who has been raised in an all-male family and has only played with guys...

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:49.110
...was finally able to make so many female friends.

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:54.930
She may learn to be more feminine with this, even though it may not be much

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:58.000
We're truly grateful to you girls.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.080
No, it's not that much.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.220
That was what I thought until recently.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:05.960
I don't know why, but she has become really masculine.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:08.550
So I have decided!

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:11.040
I will raise her to be masculine!

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:11.930
Oh?

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:14.210
Didn't he say more feminine?

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:15.260
That's the point.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:20.020
Isn't being more feminine a one-sided delusion from her stupid brothers?

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:23.940
Touma doesn't have to be pressured like that, does she?

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:25.970
Is that so?

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:27.900
Look what Touma has become.

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:30.960
Isn't she very lively?

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:35.020
"Lively" now, you say? Didn't you say she's out of hand?

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:35.740
Oh?

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:43.330
So I have decided!

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:46.400
I will make Touma a gentleman.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:50.360
Before Touma becomes the strongest in fighting just through sheer power,

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:54.220
We, who have mastered the ways, must show her the way.

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:57.510
What ways have we mastered?

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:03.230
I will take responsibility and send her to the male idol office.

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:06.900
What kind of responsibility are you taking by doing so?

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:09.990
I see.

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:12.190
I can somehow understand.

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:18.280
From Touma's primal perspective, she knew that Haruka-neesama is our family's leader.

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:28.460
All that's left, is for you or me to show our power to Touma, whoever is weaker .

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:31.130
The order will then be re-established.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:45.850
Say, Chiaki.

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:50.110
Who has the upper hand, you or I?

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:54.070
Do you want to find out now?

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:57.660
Which of us has the upper hand?

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:14.410
How about we make this deep fried chicken the prize for the winner?

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:16.170
Fine with me.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:22.350
Let's do it!

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:24.310
Bring it on!

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:33.490
Hey! Chiaki, Kana!

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:35.740
That's strange...

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:38.450
Hey! I'm coming inside.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:43.810
Is nobody home?

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.940
Aren't we still in the midst of our meal?

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.170
I-I'm sorry...

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:53.420
Did you say, "Thanks for the food?"

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:55.170
Not yet.

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:03.440
This is what Kana mentioned - Haruka's special move.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:07.050
The Iron Claw, From-Kitchen-Against-Faces style.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:09.220
Oh Touma, you've come?

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:10.940
Excuse me for intruding!

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:13.680
Will you have dinner with us?

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.050
Yes!

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:16.940
Please wait for a while.

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:22.670
Hey, are you all right?

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:26.760
Whose fault is it that things turned out this way?

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:31.350
Oh? Do you still want to fight in the middle of a meal?

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:37.710
Not at all! We're getting along very well!

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:13.600
Touma! What were you doing returning home so late?

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:17.600
Haven't I apologize for being late already?

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:19.340
No, this is unforgivable.

00:07:19.340 --> 00:07:22.320
You promised to return before five today, didn't you?

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:25.170
A man has to keep his promise.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.240
Look, Touma!

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:31.380
The cream stew I painstakingly prepared is getting cold!

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.620
Why don't you just heat up the cream stew?

00:07:34.610 --> 00:07:36.460
Enough! Shut up!

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:46.840
A man shouldn't cede to his sister's attack.

00:07:48.890 --> 00:07:51.850
Really, Natsuki is such a pain.

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:55.590
Oh, so that's what happened!

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:58.640
That Natsuki isn't bad!

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:02.440
Don't praise him! It's troublesome...

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:06.730
Oh? You've come, Touma.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:08.670
Oh, excuse me for intruding.

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:10.770
Will you have dinner here tonight as well?

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:12.590
I need to hurry home today.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.080
Oh? Why?

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:17.250
That Natsuki is too strict with me.

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:20.040
Just before I came here today...

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:22.770
Then, I'm going to Chiaki's place.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.480
Wait, Touma.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:25.210
What?

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:28.380
Are you going out? What about cleaning the bathroom?

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:30.300
I will do it when I return.

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:39.920
What's with you?

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:45.360
What are you doing?

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:49.770
I want to take a bath earlier today!

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:53.990
Enough! You're annoying! Move away!

00:08:58.610 --> 00:09:03.880
A man should dodge his sister's attack a hairsbreadth away.

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:06.590
I can't take this anymore...

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:11.450
So, does he take his sister's attack or not?

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:14.930
Which reminds me, Natsuki said something like that.

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:21.480
Touma has become more masculine recently.

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:23.970
Is that so?

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:26.740
But I don't really mind.

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:32.210
If Touma has become more manly, then I will treat her as a man.

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:37.450
So, if you act like a girl he won't be mad at you.

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:40.710
Please wait a moment.

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:46.210
What are you looking for, Kana?

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.120
Well...

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.500
There!

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:57.110
How about showing this picture to Natsuki as a proof of your femininity?

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:59.160
What kind of picture is this?

00:09:59.160 --> 00:09:59.930
Oh!

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:03.090
We took this during the afternoon nap a while back.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:06.270
This isn't how a boy would react, right?

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:10.270
Show it to him when he gets angry.

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:12.700
Is it all right to show this to him?

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:14.560
Yeah, no problem!

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:19.080
Or rather, just don't make him angry.

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:23.460
She's late!

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:25.670
What's going on? Come on!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:29.470
These meat and potatoes are... These meat and potatoes...

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:32.520
How about heating up these meat and potatoes?

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.460
I'm home.

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.090
Speak of the devil...

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:40.540
Touma!

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:43.770
I told you to return quickly.

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:48.200
Here! For you.

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:50.010
What is this?

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:57.530
Oh?

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.790
You're not angry.

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:07.280
Kana is awesome. He's not mad at me!

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:35.450
Well, Touma's birthday will be coming soon.

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:38.460
What are we going to buy for her?

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:41.640
About that... We haven't really bought anything proper for her before.

00:11:41.640 --> 00:11:43.240
That's not true.

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:45.300
I did give her something proper.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:47.000
Here, Touma.

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:52.590
I think Touma was happy.

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:56.120
But isn't it what caused Touma to be like she is now?

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:57.280
What did you say?

00:11:57.280 --> 00:12:00.280
She was happy with what I gave her.

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.140
Here, Touma.

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:08.580
That's not something for a girl who was just in kindergarten not long ago.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.840
Although she might not need it at the moment,

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:12.730
I believe she will need it one of these days.

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:14.940
One day, you say?

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:19.480
Something like that... Something like that! I won't let it happen!

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:24.670
That fellow feels the happiest when I give her a present.

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:26.290
Here, Touma.

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:31.830
I play video games with Touma often.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:33.850
I know what she likes.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:37.300
But wasn't that the video game you broke because you played it too much?

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:40.640
Touma was definitely disappointed.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:44.210
Then, what should we do?

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:47.860
I know.

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:51.100
I will buy it.

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:57.570
Hey! Kana-chan, Kana-chan!

00:12:57.570 --> 00:12:59.290
It's Hiroko-chan.

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:00.530
Yes?

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:04.810
I was wondering if you had any new Banchou news to share with me.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.420
Banchou, huh?

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:11.030
The 1st Banchou is my family's Haruka.

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:13.170
The 3rd Banchou is Yuu.

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:15.550
The 4th is Fujioka.

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:19.680
I wonder what the 2nd Banchou was like...

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:21.160
He should be in 10th grade now, right?

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:23.050
Yep.

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:28.270
Here's a special story about the 2nd Banchou's traits.

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:30.300
The school's biggest delinquent, Minami Natsuki...

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:33.800
...was no match for that person.

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:36.070
Oh! That's the trait of a Banchou!

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:38.170
Yep!

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:38.990
Oh, that's right.

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:43.440
Is Minami Natsuki your relative or something?

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:44.990
We aren't related.

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:49.410
You don't have any information either, huh?

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:54.460
The 2nd generation Banchou, huh...

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:22.150
Those eyes of Natsuki...

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.770
Hey, Natsuki.

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:32.710
You forgot your wallet, right?

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:34.880
Here, eat this.

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.760
Hitomi, it's embarrassin-

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:38.410
Here! Don't be shy.

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:39.960
Tako? Hey...

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:43.660
Eating one less meal is nothing big.

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:46.180
You really did forget your wallet, didn't you?

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:50.100
Natsuki.

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:53.850
I can see what you are thinking just by looking at your eyes.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:56.420
That...

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:58.490
...has never been told to me before.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:00.350
Well...

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:02.800
You can test it by punching me.

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:04.480
You definitely won't hit me.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:05.390
Huh?

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:06.730
If you can hit me,

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:08.470
you don't have to return the money I lent you for lunch.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.840
Being a man, I will return the money I borrowed.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:10.690
About that. I...
Being a man, I will return the money I borrowed.

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:12.180
Being a guy,
About that. I...

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:12.360
I won't hit a girl.
About that. I...

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:13.520
...said some pretty great things.
I won't hit a girl.

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:14.210
...said some pretty great things.

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:14.310
Eh?
...said some pretty great things.

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:15.440
Eh?

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:17.250
Really Maki...

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:18.620
That is impossible.

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:20.440
No no, it's something really great.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:20.590
At that time, I must have been a genius.

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:22.590
It's Haruka-senpai.
At that time, I must have been a genius.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:25.440
Maki... you are...

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:31.310
These eyes of Natsuki...

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:35.610
...they're gazing at a woman older than him that he respects.

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:37.340
He's looking at me!

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:50.180
No... Wait!

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:51.400
It's not like that!

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:51.970
Huh?

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:53.500
So suddenly?

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:57.190
Looking at me as an adult...

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:59.250
With that kind of eyes...

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:00.340
That kind of eyes?

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:02.800
No means no!

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.760
Hey, Hitomi!

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:10.310
Are you all right?

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:11.800
Ouch...

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:13.360
Sorry.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:15.080
Oh my? If it isn't Hitomi...

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.080
What's the matter?

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:18.460
H-Haruka-senpai.

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:22.240
Hitomi?

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:24.560
Uhh...

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:26.890
Excuse me!

00:16:26.890 --> 00:16:28.150
Wait a moment, Hitomi!

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:30.330
What's the matter?

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:33.920
Oh? Natsuki!

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:36.000
Yo.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:39.040
You didn't make her cry, did you?

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:46.390
It's a misunderstanding!

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:48.720
What?

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:50.320
What are those eyes?

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.780
It's a pair of "I'm saying this is a misunderstanding" eyes.

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:33.490
How troubling...

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:35.870
It's raining pretty heavily.

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:38.200
Maki-senpai!

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:41.510
Hitomi?

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:44.380
What is it?

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:45.620
Club matters?

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:46.690
No...

00:18:46.690 --> 00:18:48.710
That... It's uhh...

00:18:49.340 --> 00:18:52.630
How do I become someone that looks more mature?

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:57.460
You understand huh?

00:18:57.460 --> 00:19:00.310
Not to ask Haruka, but to ask me?

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:02.010
Yep!

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:04.500
Because I think Maki-sempai has to work harder...

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:06.400
...and has put more thought in it.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.100
I don't feel good.

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:11.290
You should ask the mature Haruka about how to be more mature.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:12.000
Eh?

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.780
That's wrong.

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:17.910
Hosaka-senpai.

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:22.060
It is true that Minami Haruka is becoming a mature person

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:24.500
because she has people who depend on her.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:27.180
But deep within her heart,

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:29.670
she wants to have someone she can be naive to.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.430
Uhh...

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:34.130
Hosaka-sempai?

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:35.180
Yes?

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:37.300
Why are you holding on to that umbrella?

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:39.260
Why are you completely wet?

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:43.460
Why are you pacing in front of a second year's classroom?

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:45.310
That's a good question!

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:48.340
Today was a bad day, an unfortunate rainy weather.

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:50.860
I forgot to bring my umbrella.

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:58.320
Did my beloved remember to bring an umbrella?

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:00.220
If she forgot...

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:03.290
I would like to give her my umbrella.

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:42.070
So I couldn't help myself.

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:45.140
I went home and got my best umbrella.

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:47.790
Why did he unbutton the shirt?

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:51.790
For the sake of passing her the umbrella at any time...

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.120
...is the reason why I am here!

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:55.750
His heat wave...

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.800
His dampness...

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.370
This is.

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:02.640
My every movement has a meaning!

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:05.270
Argh! He is splashing water all over!

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:11.230
I see. I understand now.

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:13.370
So to be like an adult.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.890
You must give your umbrella, right?

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:34.540
Those eyes of Natsuki...

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:36.420
...are the "I have forgotten my umbrella" pair of eyes.

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:40.080
Natsuki.

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:40.880
Yeah?

00:21:41.260 --> 00:21:44.290
You forgot your umbrella, didn't you?

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:45.720
I lend you mine.

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:46.840
Here.

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:49.370
Pink and such... It's embarrassing.

00:21:50.140 --> 00:21:51.730
Rabbits!

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:54.470
I still have another vinyl umbrella.

00:21:54.470 --> 00:21:55.360
Please don't worry about it.

00:21:55.800 --> 00:21:58.660
If you want to lend me one, please lend me that vinyl umbrella.

00:21:58.660 --> 00:21:59.690
Take it.

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:00.890
Hey!

00:22:00.890 --> 00:22:01.240
Pink! Rabbits!
Hey!

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:02.910
Pink! Rabbits!

00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:06.550
I told you not to be shy!

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:12.660
Those eyes of Natsuki...

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:17.770
...it's like they saw the light of hope!

00:22:23.880 --> 00:22:25.680
Oh! I'm saved.

00:22:25.680 --> 00:22:27.130
It cleared up.

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:28.370
That's great...

00:22:28.370 --> 00:22:31.340
Could you have forgotten to bring your umbrella, Haruka?

00:22:31.340 --> 00:22:33.210
That was dangerous.

00:22:33.210 --> 00:22:35.900
Yep, my sisters had...

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:39.150
Oh, your sisters...

00:22:59.960 --> 00:23:01.840
Here, Touma.

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:04.090
Your birthday present.

00:23:04.840 --> 00:23:07.340
Oh, thanks...

00:23:07.340 --> 00:23:08.560
Open and let us see.

00:23:14.690 --> 00:23:15.440
What's this?

00:23:21.630 --> 00:23:22.860
Touma.

00:23:23.730 --> 00:23:25.990
Happy birthday.

00:23:27.990 --> 00:23:31.240
Th-Thanks.

00:23:32.250 --> 00:23:32.830
Kana.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:34.510
Natsuki wasn't angry at all!

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:35.620
See? As I said.

00:23:36.050 --> 00:23:37.130
Sound interesting.

00:23:37.130 --> 00:23:38.650
Haruka, all thanks to Haruka!

00:23:38.650 --> 00:23:40.660
Nothing, nothing! There's nothing at all!

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:42.900
Next, on Minami-ke Okaeri...

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:44.190
Becoming fun.

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:46.260
This is secret info!
